  "descriptionEn": "A string containing emoji (family ZWJ sequences, flags, skin tones) pops in one visible character at a time without breaking any of them.",
  "focus": "枠 1 つ＝見た目の 1 文字（書記素）。下の数字は分割方法ごとの個数で、赤が正しい数。家族や国旗の絵文字は複数のコードポイントでできているので、split(\"\") や [...str] だと壊れる。",
  "focusEn": "One box = one visible character (grapheme). The numbers compare split methods; red is correct. Family and flag emoji are several code points, so split(\"\") or [...str] tears them apart.",
  "caution": "分割には Intl.Segmenter（granularity: \"grapheme\"）を使う。古いブラウザ向けにはフォールバックを。分割後の span は aria-hidden にし、元の文を aria-label で読ませる。",
  "cautionEn": "Split with Intl.Segmenter (granularity: \"grapheme\") and provide a fallback for old browsers. Mark spans aria-hidden and expose the original string via aria-label.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "Intl.Segmenter grapheme / scale 0 → 1 / spring stiffness 400 damping 20 / stagger 0.04s",
  "recipeEn": "Intl.Segmenter grapheme / scale 0 → 1 / spring stiffness 400 damping 20 / stagger 0.04s",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "時間・状態変化",
