  "recipes": {
   "css": ".ch { display:inline-block; transform-origin:50% 100%; }\n.title:hover .ch { animation: jelly .9s ease-in-out both; animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 60ms); }\n@keyframes jelly {\n  30% { transform: scale(1.25, .75); }  40% { transform: scale(.75, 1.25); }\n  50% { transform: scale(1.15, .85); }  65% { transform: scale(.95, 1.05); }\n  75% { transform: scale(1.05, .95); }  100% { transform: scale(1, 1); }\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .title:hover .ch { animation:none; } }",
   "waapi": "const frames = [\n  { transform: 'scale(1,1)' },\n  { transform: 'scale(1.25,.75)', offset: .3 }, { transform: 'scale(.75,1.25)', offset: .4 },\n  { transform: 'scale(1.15,.85)', offset: .5 }, { transform: 'scale(.95,1.05)', offset: .65 },\n  { transform: 'scale(1.05,.95)', offset: .75 }, { transform: 'scale(1,1)' }\n];\ntitle.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\n  if (matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) return;\n  title.querySelectorAll('.ch').forEach((c, i) => {\n    if (c.getAnimations().length) return;            // 再生中は重ねない\n    c.style.transformOrigin = '50% 100%';\n    c.animate(frames, { duration: 900, delay: i * 60, easing: 'ease-in-out' });\n  });\n});",
   "gsap": "const split = SplitText.create('.title', { type: 'chars' });\ngsap.set(split.chars, { transformOrigin: '50% 100%' });\ngsap.timeline({ defaults: { duration: .09, ease: 'sine.inOut', stagger: .06 } })\n  .to(split.chars, { scaleX: 1.25, scaleY: .75, duration: .27 })\n  .to(split.chars, { scaleX: .75, scaleY: 1.25 }, '<.27')\n  .to(split.chars, { scaleX: 1.15, scaleY: .85 }, '<.09')\n  .to(split.chars, { scaleX: .95, scaleY: 1.05, duration: .135 }, '<.09')\n  .to(split.chars, { scaleX: 1, scaleY: 1, duration: .3 }, '<.135');",
   "ae": "1. アニメーター：スケール → グループ化：文字、グループ揃え 0%, 0%（ベースライン基点）\n2. スケール [80,130] → [120,85] → [100,100] を 3〜4 フレームずつ\n3. 範囲セレクター → 高度 → シェイプ：矩形、文字ごとに時間差（オフセットをキー）\n4. グラフエディターで各キーをイーズ",
   "aeEn": "1. Animator: Scale → Grouping: Character, Grouping Alignment 0%, 0% (baseline pivot)\n2. Scale [80,130] → [120,85] → [100,100], 3–4 frames apart\n3. Range Selector → Advanced → Shape: Square; keyframe Offset for per-letter delay\n4. Ease each key in the Graph Editor"
  },
