   "aeEn": "1. Shape layer: a straight path under the word, stroke = font size × 0.08\n2. Add → Trim Paths\n3. End 0% → 100% over 12 frames (Easy Ease)\n4. Exit by animating Start 0% → 100% so it leaves to the right"
