  "focusEn": "Outgoing and incoming words move together, exactly one line-height apart, so the window never goes empty. A 20ms per-letter lag adds a ripple. The faint letters outside the window are the hidden overflow.",
  "caution": "行の高さぴったりで overflow:hidden にしないと、ディセンダーや隣の語がのぞく。読み上げ用に最終語を固定で持つ。prefers-reduced-motion ではクロスフェードに。",
  "cautionEn": "Clip to exactly one line-height or descenders and the next word will peek in. Keep a stable accessible label. Fall back to a crossfade under prefers-reduced-motion.",
  "tips": [],
