   "aeEn": "1. Make old/new word layers 3D; push the anchor point Z back by height/2\n2. Place the new word on the bottom face with X Rotation −90°\n3. Parent both to a null and rotate the null 0 → 90° on X (18 frames)\n4. Per letter: enable per-character 3D, X Rotation animator + Range Selector offset 1–2 frames"
