   "css": ".out { animation: swipeOut .3s cubic-bezier(.55,0,1,.45) forwards; }\n.in  { animation: swipeIn .52s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }\n@keyframes swipeOut { to { transform: translateX(-300px) skewX(-20deg); opacity:0; } }\n@keyframes swipeIn {\n  0%   { transform: translateX(220px) skewX(-20deg); opacity:0; }\n  60%  { transform: translateX(0) skewX(-20deg); opacity:1; }\n  100% { transform: none; }\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .out, .in { animation-duration:1ms; } }",
   "gsap": "gsap.timeline()\n  .to('.word.now', { x: -300, skewX: -20, autoAlpha: 0, duration: .3, ease: 'power3.in' })\n  .fromTo('.word.next', { x: 220, skewX: -20, autoAlpha: 0 },\n    { x: 0, autoAlpha: 1, duration: .4, ease: 'expo.out' }, '-=.18')\n  .to('.word.next', { skewX: 0, duration: .2, ease: 'power2.out' }, '-=.2');",
   "ae": "1. アニメーター：傾き 20、位置 (-300, 0)\n2. 範囲セレクター：上へ傾斜、オフセットで文字ごとに抜ける\n3. 新語は位置 (220,0) → 0 を 12 フレーム（イーズアウト強）\n4. 最後の 6 フレームで傾き 20 → 0",
   "aeEn": "1. Animator: Skew 20, Position (−300, 0)\n2. Range Selector: Ramp Up; animate Offset so letters leave in sequence\n3. New word Position (220,0) → 0 over 12 frames (strong ease-out)\n4. Settle Skew 20 → 0 in the last 6 frames"
