  "recipes": {
   "css": ".term { height: calc(4 * 1.6em); overflow: hidden; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; line-height: 1.6; }\n.term-inner { transition: transform .14s cubic-bezier(.33, 1, .68, 1); }\n.term .cursor { display: inline-block; width: .6em; height: 1.2em; background: currentColor;\n  vertical-align: text-bottom; animation: blink 1s steps(1) infinite; }\n@keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .term-inner { transition: none; } .term .cursor { animation: none; } }",
   "waapi": "// 行を足すたびに内側を 1 行ぶん上へ（表示 4 行）\nconst inner = document.querySelector('.term-inner'), VIS = 4;\nfunction addLine(text) {\n  const div = document.createElement('div'); div.textContent = text; inner.append(div);\n  const over = Math.max(0, inner.children.length - VIS);\n  inner.style.transform = `translateY(calc(${-over} * 1.6em))`;   // CSS の transition で滑る\n}",
   "remotion": "const lines = ['$ npm install', 'added 214 packages', '$ npm test', '✓ 48 passed', '❯ ' + text];\nconst lh = 32, VIS = 4, start = i => i * 12;                       // 12f ごとに 1 行\nconst shown = lines.filter((_, i) => frame >= start(i));\nconst scroll = lines.reduce((a, _, i) => i < VIS ? a :\n  a + lh * interpolate(frame, [start(i), start(i) + 4], [0, 1], { extrapolateLeft: 'clamp', extrapolateRight: 'clamp', easing: Easing.out(Easing.cubic) }), 0);\nreturn <div style={{ height: lh * VIS, overflow: 'hidden' }}><div style={{ transform: `translateY(${-scroll}px)` }}>\n  {shown.map((l, i) => <div key={i} style={{ height: lh }}>{l}</div>)}</div></div>;",
   "ae": "1. 1行ずつ別テキストレイヤー（等幅）、ソーステキストに substr で 60 cps のタイプ\n2. 全行を親ヌルにまとめる\n3. 新しい行の開始フレームごとに、親ヌルの位置 Y を −行送り（例 −32px）だけキー、4f のイーズアウト\n4. カーソルは「█」のテキストレイヤー、不透明度に Math.floor(time*2)%2*100",
   "aeEn": "1. One monospaced text layer per line, Source Text substr for 60 cps typing\n2. Parent all lines to a Null\n3. At each new line’s start, keyframe the Null’s Y by −line height (e.g. −32px), 4-frame ease-out\n4. Cursor = a \"█\" text layer with Opacity expression Math.floor(time*2)%2*100"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://www.provideocoalition.com/typewriter-effects-in-after-effects/"
  ],
