  "descriptionEn": "Characters leap stretched tall, flatten sideways at the moment of landing and spring back — conveying weight and elasticity.",
  "focus": "速く動いている間は進行方向に伸び（1.2 / 0.85）、着地の 80ms で横につぶれ（0.7 / 1.25）、弾性で戻る。面積がほぼ一定なので「柔らかい塊」に見える。変形の基準点は文字の足元（ベースライン）。",
  "focusEn": "While moving fast the glyph stretches along its path (1.2 / 0.85), flattens to 0.7 / 1.25 in the 80ms of impact, then springs back elastically. Area stays roughly constant, so it reads as a soft mass. The transform origin is the baseline.",
  "caution": "基準点を中央にすると床から浮いたり沈んだりする。必ず transform-origin を下端に。つぶれは一瞬（2〜5 フレーム）で十分で、長いと「止まって見える」。可読性が下がるので見出しの一部や短い語だけに。",
  "cautionEn": "A centred origin makes letters float above or sink into the floor — always set transform-origin to the bottom. The squash only needs 2–5 frames; longer looks like a freeze. It hurts legibility, so keep it to short words or one word of a headline.",
