  "recipes": {
   "css": ".domino { letter-spacing: .35em; }\n.domino span { display: inline-block; transform-origin: 100% 100%;\n  animation: topple .3s cubic-bezier(.55, 0, 1, .45) forwards; animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 120ms + .5s); }\n.domino span:last-child { animation-name: topple-last; animation-duration: .6s; }\n@keyframes topple { to { transform: rotate(28deg); } }\n@keyframes topple-last { 50% { transform: rotate(88deg); } 75% { transform: rotate(80deg); } to { transform: rotate(86deg); } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .domino span { animation: none; } }",
   "gsap": "const split = SplitText.create('.domino', { type: 'chars', aria: 'auto' });\ngsap.set(split.chars, { transformOrigin: '100% 100%' });\nconst tl = gsap.timeline();\nsplit.chars.forEach((c, i) => {\n  const last = i === split.chars.length - 1;\n  tl.to(c, { rotation: last ? 88 : 28, duration: last ? 0.3 : 0.12, ease: 'power2.in' }, i * 0.12);\n  if (last) tl.to(c, { rotation: 80, duration: 0.08, ease: 'power1.out', yoyo: true, repeat: 1 });\n});\n// 元に戻す：tl.reverse()",
   "ae": "1. テキストレイヤー → アンカーポイントのグループ化：文字、グループ化の配置 (50%, 50%)（右下）\n2. アニメーター：回転 28°\n3. エクスプレッションセレクター：t = clamp((time - inPoint - textIndex*0.12)/0.12, 0, 1); 100*t*t\n4. 最後の文字だけ別のアニメーター（範囲を末尾 1 文字に）で 88° → 80° → 86°",
   "aeEn": "1. Text layer → Anchor Point Grouping: Character, Grouping Alignment (50%, 50%) (bottom right)\n2. Animator: Rotation 28°\n3. Expression Selector: t = clamp((time - inPoint - textIndex*0.12)/0.12, 0, 1); 100*t*t\n4. A second animator ranged to the last character only: 88° → 80° → 86°"
  },
