  "description": "一文が波打つ曲線に沿って途切れなく流れ続ける。",
  "descriptionEn": "A sentence flows endlessly along a wavy curve.",
  "focus": "文が曲線に沿ってしなりながら流れ、端で切れ目なくつながる。1 単位（文＋区切り）ぶん進むと最初と同じ絵に戻るのがループの仕組み。",
  "focusEn": "The sentence bends with the curve and never shows a seam: after travelling exactly one unit (text + separator) the frame repeats.",
  "caution": "流れ続ける文字は WCAG 2.2.2（一時停止・停止）の対象。5 秒を超えて動くなら停止手段を用意する。曲率が強いと文字が重なるので、緩い曲線と広めの字間で。",
  "cautionEn": "Continuously moving text falls under WCAG 2.2.2 (Pause, Stop, Hide): provide a pause if it runs longer than 5 s. Tight curves make glyphs collide; keep the curve gentle.",
  "tips": [],
