  "focusEn": "The shadow is a slightly offset copy of the text; only its diagonal stripes keep moving, so the letters stay still while gaining a printed, dimensional look.",
  "caution": "縞の間隔が細かすぎると画面によってモアレが出る。小さい文字では縞がつぶれるので大見出し専用。読み上げで 2 回読まれないよう、複製は擬似要素（content:attr）で作る。",
  "cautionEn": "Very fine stripes can moiré on some screens and collapse at small sizes — keep it for large headings. Build the copy with a pseudo-element (content: attr()) so screen readers do not read the text twice.",
  "tips": [],
