  "easing": "steps(1)",
  "feelings": [
   "きびきび"
  ],
  "usages": [
   "テキスト",
   "UI"
  ],
  "description": "文字の横方向のスライスが数フレームだけ左右にずれ、壊れた映像のように見える。",
  "descriptionEn": "Horizontal slices of the word jump left and right for a few frames, like a corrupted video signal.",
  "focus": "切れ目の位置とずれ量はバーストごとに変わる。1〜3 コマだけ乱して、すぐ元の位置へ戻るのがポイント。薄い元位置のゴーストで「ずれ」が読める。",
  "focusEn": "Cut positions and offsets change every burst. It breaks for only 1–3 frames and snaps back; the faint ghost at the original position shows the displacement.",
  "caution": "長く続けると読めないうえ、目が疲れる。乱すのは全体の 2〜3 割の時間まで。点滅に近い速さになるので reduced-motion では止める。",
  "cautionEn": "If it runs long the word becomes unreadable and tiring. Keep glitching to 20–30% of the time, and disable it for reduced motion since it is close to flashing.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "スライス 6〜8 本 / 1〜3 コマのバースト / 更新 50〜80ms / Δx ±24px",
  "recipeEn": "6–8 slices / 1–3 frame bursts / update every 50–80ms / Δx ±24px",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "時間・状態変化",
  "triggerEn": "Time or state change",
  "tech": [
   "CSS",
   "AE",
   "Canvas"
  ],
  "cost": "軽い",
  "costEn": "Light",
  "inputs": [
   "自動"
  ],
