  "values": [
   "走査線 2px・不透明度 .15",
   "ノイズ帯 高さ 6%・3s linear",
   "跳ね 2〜4s ごと",
   "色ずれ ±2px"
  ],
  "valuesEn": [
   "scanlines 2px at .15 opacity",
   "noise band 6% tall, 3s linear",
   "jump every 2–4s",
   "chroma ±2px"
  ],
  "recipes": {
   "css": ".vhs { position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n  text-shadow: -2px 0 rgba(255,0,60,.8), 2px 0 rgba(0,200,255,.8);\n  animation: jump 3.2s steps(1) infinite; }\n.vhs::before { /* 走査線 */\n  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,.15) 0 1px, transparent 1px 2px); }\n.vhs::after { /* ノイズ帯 */\n  content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; height: 6%; top: -6%;\n  background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(255,255,255,.18), transparent);\n  animation: band 3s linear infinite; }\n@keyframes band { to { top: 100%; } }\n@keyframes jump { 0%, 60%, 66%, 100% { transform: none; } 61% { transform: translateY(-7px); } 63% { transform: translateY(4px); } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .vhs, .vhs::after { animation: none; } }",
   "canvas": "// 帯の数行だけ横にずらす\nconst by = (t / 3 % 1) * H, bh = H * .06;\nfor (let k = 0; k < 4; k++) {\n  ctx.save(); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.rect(0, by + k * bh / 4, W, bh / 4); ctx.clip();\n  ctx.drawImage(frameCanvas, (Math.random() - .5) * 14, 0);\n  ctx.restore();\n}",
   "ae": "1. テキストに「チャンネルシフト」または RGB 分離（R を -2px、B を +2px）\n2. 調整レイヤーに「ベネチアンブラインド」（幅 2px・不透明度 15%）で走査線\n3. 細い矩形マスク＋「波形ワープ」の帯を 3 秒で上から下へ\n4. 2〜4 秒ごとに位置 Y を 3 フレームだけ ±7px（停止キー）",
   "aeEn": "1. Add Shift Channels / RGB split to the text (R −2px, B +2px)\n2. Adjustment layer with Venetian Blinds (2px, 15%) for scanlines\n3. A thin masked band with Wave Warp moving top → bottom over 3s\n4. Every 2–4s, jump Position Y ±7px for 3 frames (hold keys)"
  },
