  "description": "文字が回転する円筒やリングの表面に巻き付き、奥の文字は小さく暗く、手前に回ってくると大きく見える。",
  "descriptionEn": "Text wraps around a rotating cylinder: letters at the back look small and dim, and grow as they come around to the front.",
  "focus": "各文字は円周上の角度に置かれ、正面を向く度合い（cos）で幅が縮む。奥の文字は裏返って暗く、手前に来るほど大きく明るい。",
  "focusEn": "Each letter sits at an angle on the circumference; its width shrinks with how far it faces away (cos). Back letters are mirrored and dim, front ones large and bright.",
  "caution": "常に半分は裏返っていて読めない。文字列は繰り返しを前提に、区切り記号を入れる。スクリーンリーダー用に元の文字列を 1 回だけ置く。",
  "cautionEn": "Half the ring is always mirrored and unreadable, so design for repetition with a separator. Provide the string once for screen readers.",
