   "css": "@property --wght { syntax: '<number>'; inherits: false; initial-value: 100; }\n.c { display: inline-block; opacity: 0; font-variation-settings: 'wght' var(--wght);\n  animation: grow .9s cubic-bezier(.215,.61,.355,1) forwards; animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 50ms); }\n@keyframes grow { 20% { opacity: 1; } to { opacity: 1; --wght: 800; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .c { animation: none; opacity: 1; --wght: 800; } }",
   "remotion": "return [...text].map((c, i) => {\n  const p = interpolate(frame - i * 1.5, [0, 27], [0, 1], { extrapolateLeft: 'clamp', extrapolateRight: 'clamp', easing: Easing.out(Easing.cubic) });\n  return <span key={i} style={{ opacity: Math.min(1, p * 4), fontVariationSettings: `'wght' ${100 + 700 * p}` }}>{c}</span>;\n});",
   "ae": "1. テキストレイヤー → アニメーター追加 → 可変フォント軸 → Weight と 不透明度\n2. Weight 100（元は 800）、不透明度 0%\n3. 範囲セレクター → 高度 → シェイプ：上へ傾斜、イーズ（低）80%\n4. オフセット -100% → 100% をおよそ（0.9 + 0.05×文字数）秒で",
   "aeEn": "1. Text layer → Animate → Variable Font Axes → Weight, plus Opacity\n2. Weight 100 (base 800), Opacity 0%\n3. Range Selector → Advanced → Shape: Ramp Up, Ease Low 80%\n4. Offset -100% → 100% over about (0.9 + 0.05 × chars) s"
