  "description": "巨大な文字の帯が横に流れ続け、スクロールすると流れが加速し、逆方向にスクロールすると向きが反転する。",
  "descriptionEn": "A band of huge type scrolls sideways forever; scrolling speeds it up, and scrolling the other way flips its direction.",
  "focus": "止まっていても一定速度で流れ、スクロールの速さが倍率として上乗せされる（最大 ×5）。上へスクロールした瞬間に向きが変わり、勢いが落ちるとまた基本速度に戻る。2 本目の帯は逆向き。",
  "focusEn": "The band always drifts at a base speed; scroll velocity adds a multiplier (up to ×5). Scrolling up flips the direction instantly, and as momentum fades it returns to base speed. The second band runs the other way.",
  "caution": "帯の中身は複製なので、スクリーンリーダーには 1 回だけ読ませる（複製は aria-hidden）。継ぎ目が見えないよう、帯の幅の整数倍で折り返す。reduced-motion では止める。",
  "cautionEn": "The band is made of copies — expose the text once and aria-hide the clones. Wrap at an exact multiple of the copy width to hide the seam. Stop it under reduced motion.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "baseVelocity 100 / spring damping 50 / stiffness 400 / velocity [0,1000] → ×[0,5] / copies 6",
  "recipeEn": "baseVelocity 100 / spring damping 50 / stiffness 400 / velocity [0,1000] → ×[0,5] / copies 6",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "スクロール",
  "triggerEn": "Scroll",
  "tech": [
   "GSAP",
   "Motion"
  ],
  "cost": "軽い",
  "costEn": "Light",
  "inputs": [
   "スクロール"
  ],
  "inputsEn": [
   "Scroll"
  ],
  "reduced": "動きを止め、文字が読める代表のコマを表示します。",
  "reducedEn": "Stop the motion and show a representative frame where the text is readable.",
  "accent": "cyan",
  "featured": false,
  "values": [
   "baseVelocity 100",
   "spring damping 50 / stiffness 400",
   "velocity [0,1000] → ×[0,5]",
   "copies 6"
  ],
  "valuesEn": [
   "baseVelocity 100",
   "spring damping 50 / stiffness 400",
   "velocity [0,1000] → ×[0,5]",
   "copies 6"
  ],
  "recipes": {
   "motion": "import { motion, useScroll, useVelocity, useSpring, useTransform, useMotionValue, useAnimationFrame } from 'motion/react';\nimport { wrap } from 'motion';   // wrap(min, max, v) で範囲内に折り返す\nimport { useRef } from 'react';\nfunction Marquee({ text, baseVelocity = 100 }) {\n  const baseX = useMotionValue(0);\n  const { scrollY } = useScroll();\n  const smooth = useSpring(useVelocity(scrollY), { damping: 50, stiffness: 400 });\n  const factor = useTransform(smooth, [0, 1000], [0, 5], { clamp: false });\n  const x = useTransform(baseX, v => `${wrap(-20, -45, v)}%`);\n  const dir = useRef(1);\n  useAnimationFrame((t, delta) => {\n    if (factor.get() < 0) dir.current = -1; else if (factor.get() > 0) dir.current = 1;\n    let move = dir.current * baseVelocity * (delta / 1000);\n    move += dir.current * move * factor.get();\n    baseX.set(baseX.get() + move);\n  });\n  return <div className=\"band\" aria-label={text}><motion.div style={{ x }} aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    {Array.from({ length: 6 }, (_, i) => <span key={i}>{text} · </span>)}\n  </motion.div></div>;\n}",
   "gsap": "const loop = gsap.to('.band-inner', { xPercent: -50, ease: 'none', duration: 12, repeat: -1 });\nScrollTrigger.create({ onUpdate: self => {\n  const v = self.getVelocity();\n  gsap.to(loop, { timeScale: Math.sign(v || 1) * (1 + Math.min(5, Math.abs(v) / 200)), duration: .3, overwrite: true });\n  gsap.to(loop, { timeScale: Math.sign(v || 1), duration: 1, delay: .3 });   // 勢いが落ちたら基本速度へ\n} });"
  },
