  "description": "ホバーすると各文字が上へ転がり抜け、下から同じ文字の複製が転がり込んでくる。ボタンの定番。",
  "descriptionEn": "On hover each character rolls up out of view while an identical copy rolls in from below — a classic button effect.",
  "focus": "文字ごとに 20ms ずつずれるので、左から波のように入れ替わる。元の文字と複製は 1 行分の高さだけ離れて同時に動き、切り抜き枠の外は見えない。",
  "focusEn": "A 20 ms offset per character makes the swap ripple from left to right. Original and clone move together, exactly one line-height apart, and everything outside the clip box is hidden.",
  "caution": "複製は読み上げ対象から外す（aria-hidden / ::after）。ホバーのたびに長い時間がかかるとボタンが重く感じるので、合計 0.5 秒以内に。",
  "cautionEn": "Hide the clone from screen readers (aria-hidden or ::after). Keep the total under ~0.5 s or the button feels sluggish.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "y 0 → −100% / stagger 20ms / 400ms / ease out(3)",
  "recipeEn": "y 0 → −100% / stagger 20ms / 400ms / ease out(3)",
