  "description": "各桁が機械式カウンターのように縦に回転して新しい値へ。増えた桁はフェードし、桁の上下端はマスクで溶ける。",
  "descriptionEn": "Each digit spins vertically like a mechanical counter to its new value; added digits fade in and the top and bottom edges dissolve through a mask.",
  "focus": "各桁は 0〜9 の帯を窓の中で上下に送るだけ。増えるときは上へ、減るときは下へ回る（trend）。窓の上下 0.25em をマスクで溶かすので、数字が「筒に巻かれている」ように見える。",
  "focusEn": "Each digit is just a 0–9 strip sliding in a window—up when increasing, down when decreasing (trend). The 0.25 em mask at the top and bottom makes the digits look wrapped around a drum.",
  "caution": "回転中の値は読めないので、最終値だけを読み上げ用に持つ。桁ごとの回転量が大きすぎると目が追えない（750ms 前後まで）。等幅数字が前提。",
  "cautionEn": "Mid-spin values are unreadable—expose only the final value to assistive tech. Keep spins near 750 ms. Requires tabular figures.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "spin 750ms / opacity 350ms ease-out / マスク 0.25em / line-height 0.85–1",
  "recipeEn": "spin 750ms / opacity 350ms ease-out / mask 0.25em / line-height 0.85–1",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "時間・状態変化",
  "triggerEn": "Time or state change",
