  "focusEn": "Random digits change every 40 ms and lock left-to-right every 120 ms. Commas, decimal points and % never move, so the magnitude reads before the digits settle.",
  "caution": "等幅数字（tabular-nums）でないと幅がガタつく。高速な数字の点滅は長く続けない（全体 1 秒程度）。読み上げには最終値だけを渡す。",
  "cautionEn": "Without tabular figures the width jitters. Keep the flicker short (about 1 s total) and expose only the final value to screen readers.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "更新 40ms / 確定 120ms ずつ / tabular-nums / 記号は固定",
