  "description": "3・2・1 と数字が一つずつ中央で大きく現れ、拡大しながら薄れて次の数字に場を譲る。",
  "descriptionEn": "Numbers 3, 2, 1 appear one at a time in the centre, then grow and fade to make way for the next.",
  "focus": "各数字は 0.15 秒で「ポン」と出て（back.out）、残り 0.85 秒で 2.2 倍に広がりながら消える。リングが 1 秒を一周で示すので、テンポが目で数えられる。",
  "focusEn": "Each number pops in over 0.15 s (back.out) and spends the remaining 0.85 s expanding to 2.2× while fading. The ring sweeps once per second, so the beat is countable.",
  "caution": "拡大＋フェードは視界いっぱいに広がるので、画面全体ではなく枠の中で。ゲームや配信の開始合図向き。読み上げには「3、2、1」を一度に渡すか、無視させる。",
  "cautionEn": "Zoom-and-fade fills the view—keep it inside a frame rather than full screen. Ideal as a start cue for games and streams. Give screen readers the sequence once, or hide it.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "1 つ 1 秒 / scale 0.6 → 1 → 2.2 / 不透明度 0.85s で 0",
  "recipeEn": "1s per number / scale 0.6 → 1 → 2.2 / opacity fades over 0.85s",
