  "recipes": {
   "css": "/* 3 つの <span> を重ね、1 秒ずつずらす */\n.cd span { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; opacity: 0;\n  animation: pop 1s both; animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 1s); }\n@keyframes pop {\n  0%   { opacity: 0; scale: .6; animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1); }\n  15%  { opacity: 1; scale: 1;  animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(.55,0,1,.45); }\n  100% { opacity: 0; scale: 2.2; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .cd span { animation-name: fade; } @keyframes fade { 15%, 85% { opacity: 1; } } }",
   "gsap": "const tl = gsap.timeline();\ngsap.utils.toArray('.cd span').forEach(el => {\n  tl.fromTo(el, { scale: .6, autoAlpha: 0 }, { scale: 1, autoAlpha: 1, duration: .15, ease: 'back.out(2)' })\n    .to(el, { scale: 2.2, autoAlpha: 0, duration: .85, ease: 'power2.in' });\n});",
   "remotion": "// 1 つ 30 フレーム（30fps）\nconst i = Math.floor(frame / 30), f = frame % 30;\nconst s = f < 5 ? interpolate(f, [0, 5], [.6, 1], { easing: Easing.out(Easing.back(2)) })\n                : interpolate(f, [5, 30], [1, 2.2], { easing: Easing.in(Easing.quad) });\nconst o = interpolate(f, [0, 3, 5, 30], [0, 1, 1, 0]);\nreturn <div style={{ scale: s, opacity: o }}>{3 - i}</div>;",
   "ae": "1. 「3」「2」「1」を別レイヤーにして 1 秒ずつずらして並べる\n2. スケール 60 → 100%（0.15 秒・オーバーシュート）→ 220%（0.85 秒・イーズイン）\n3. 不透明度 100 → 0%（後半 0.85 秒）\n4. 円シェイプのパスのトリミング 0 → 100% を 1 秒ごとに",
   "aeEn": "1. Put “3”, “2”, “1” on separate layers, offset by 1 s\n2. Scale 60 → 100% (0.15 s, overshoot) → 220% (0.85 s, ease in)\n3. Opacity 100 → 0% over the last 0.85 s\n4. Circle shape Trim Paths 0 → 100% each second"
  },
