  "description": "字幕の単語が一つずつ弾むスケールで飛び出し、バネのように揺れて収まる。",
  "descriptionEn": "Caption words spring out one by one with a bouncy scale, wobbling like a spring before they settle.",
  "focus": "ζ ≈ 0.5 のスプリングなので約 16% 行き過ぎてから戻る。5 フレーム差で語ごとに位相がずれ、揺れが波のように右へ伝わる。下のグラフの点が各語の現在位置。",
  "focusEn": "With ζ ≈ 0.5 the spring overshoots by about 16% and settles back. A 5-frame offset puts each word at a different phase, so the wobble ripples to the right — the dots on the curve are each word right now.",
  "caution": "揺れが長いと読み始めが遅れる。字幕では damping を上げる（15–20）か、overshoot を数％に抑える。動きを減らす設定ではフェードだけにする。",
  "cautionEn": "A long wobble delays reading. For captions raise damping (15–20) or keep overshoot to a few percent. With reduced motion, fall back to a plain fade.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "5 フレーム差 / damping 10 / stiffness 100 / mass 1 / scale 0.6 → 1 / opacity = spring 値",
  "recipeEn": "stagger 5 frames / damping 10 / stiffness 100 / mass 1 / scale 0.6 → 1 / opacity = spring value",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "時間・状態変化",
  "triggerEn": "Time or state change",
  "tech": [
   "Remotion"
  ],
  "cost": "軽い",
  "costEn": "Light",
  "inputs": [
   "自動"
  ],
  "inputsEn": [
   "Automatic"
  ],
  "reduced": "動きを止め、文字が読める代表のコマを表示します。",
  "reducedEn": "Stop the motion and show a representative frame where the text is readable.",
  "accent": "cyan",
  "featured": false,
  "values": [
   "5 フレーム差",
   "damping 10 / stiffness 100 / mass 1",
   "scale 0.6 → 1",
   "opacity = spring 値"
  ],
  "valuesEn": [
   "stagger 5 frames",
   "damping 10 / stiffness 100 / mass 1",
   "scale 0.6 → 1",
   "opacity = spring value"
  ],
  "recipes": {
   "remotion": "const frame = useCurrentFrame(); const { fps } = useVideoConfig();\nreturn words.map((w, i) => {\n  const s = spring({ frame: frame - i * 5, fps, config: { damping: 10, stiffness: 100, mass: 1 } });\n  return <span key={i} style={{ display: 'inline-block', opacity: Math.min(1, s),\n    transform: `scale(${interpolate(s, [0, 1], [0.6, 1])})` }}>{w}&nbsp;</span>;\n});",
   "motion": "import { animate, stagger } from 'motion';\nanimate('.cap .w', { scale: [0.6, 1], opacity: [0, 1] },\n  { type: 'spring', stiffness: 100, damping: 10, mass: 1, delay: stagger(5 / 30) });",
   "css": "/* linear() でスプリングを近似（ζ≈0.5） */\n.w { display: inline-block; animation: pop .8s linear(0, .45 12%, .98 25%, 1.16 35%, 1.08 50%, .98 65%, 1.01 80%, 1) both;\n  animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 167ms); }\n@keyframes pop { from { scale: .6; opacity: 0; } to { scale: 1; opacity: 1; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .w { animation: none; } }"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://www.remotion.dev/docs/spring",
   "https://www.remotion.dev/docs/interpolate"
  ],
  "unit": "word",
  "sampleJa": "それ 本当に すごい",
  "sampleEn": "That is so cool",
