  "description": "歌詞の各語(音節)が、発音される長さにぴったり合わせて左から右へ色で塗られていく。",
  "descriptionEn": "Each lyric word (syllable) is wiped with colour from left to right over exactly the time it is sung.",
  "focus": "塗りの速さは語ごとに違う。長く伸ばす語はゆっくり、短い語は一瞬で塗られるので、文字が「歌の長さ」をそのまま見せる。",
  "focusEn": "Wipe speed differs per word: held notes fill slowly, short ones snap. The text literally shows how long each word is sung.",
  "caution": "塗り色と元の色の明度差を大きくする（境目が見えないと意味がない）。塗りは線形のまま（イージングを付けると歌とずれて見える）。",
  "cautionEn": "Make the filled and base colours differ strongly in lightness, or the wipe edge is lost. Keep the wipe linear — easing makes it drift from the singing.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "塗り 0% → 100%（語の長さ） / 線形・clamp / \\kf 単位 1/100 秒 / 語ごとに別の速さ",
  "recipeEn": "fill 0% → 100% over token duration / linear, clamped / \\kf in centiseconds / different speed per word",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "時間・状態変化",
  "triggerEn": "Time or state change",
  "tech": [
   "CSS",
   "Remotion",
   "AE",
   "Canvas"
  ],
  "cost": "軽い",
  "costEn": "Light",
  "inputs": [
   "自動"
  ],
  "inputsEn": [
   "Automatic"
  ],
  "reduced": "動きを止め、文字が読める代表のコマを表示します。",
  "reducedEn": "Stop the motion and show a representative frame where the text is readable.",
  "accent": "coral",
  "featured": false,
  "values": [
   "塗り 0% → 100%（語の長さ）",
   "線形・clamp",
   "\\kf 単位 1/100 秒",
   "語ごとに別の速さ"
  ],
  "valuesEn": [
   "fill 0% → 100% over token duration",
   "linear, clamped",
   "\\kf in centiseconds",
   "different speed per word"
  ],
  "recipes": {
   "remotion": "// トークンごとの塗り率。範囲外は clamp\nconst ms = (frame / fps) * 1000;\nreturn tokens.map(tk => {\n  const p = interpolate(ms, [tk.fromMs, tk.toMs], [0, 100], { extrapolateLeft: 'clamp', extrapolateRight: 'clamp' });\n  return <span key={tk.fromMs} style={{ background: `linear-gradient(90deg, #ff725e ${p}%, #fff ${p}%)`,\n    WebkitBackgroundClip: 'text', backgroundClip: 'text', color: 'transparent' }}>{tk.text}</span>;\n});",
   "css": "/* 語ごとに --d（歌う長さ）を入れる */\n.syl { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent) 50%, #fff 50%) 100% 0 / 200% 100%;\n  -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;\n  animation: fill var(--d) linear var(--at) forwards; }\n@keyframes fill { to { background-position: 0 0; } }",
   "canvas": "// 塗った色のコピーを clip で切り抜いて重ねる\nctx.fillStyle = '#fff'; ctx.fillText(word, x, y);\nconst p = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, (t - from) / (to - from)));\nctx.save(); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.rect(x, y - size, width * p, size * 1.4); ctx.clip();\nctx.fillStyle = accent; ctx.fillText(word, x, y); ctx.restore();",
   "ae": "1. アニメーター：塗りのカラー（アクセント色）\n2. 範囲セレクター → 単位：インデックス、基準：文字\n3. 語ごとに開始/終了を拍に合わせてキー（リニア）\n4. ASS 字幕なら {\\kf45} のように 1/100 秒で指定",
   "aeEn": "1. Animator: Fill Color (accent)\n2. Range Selector → Units: Index, Based On: Characters\n3. Key Start/End per word on the beat (linear)\n4. In ASS subtitles use {\\kf45} (centiseconds)"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://www.remotion.dev/docs/interpolate",
   "https://www.remotion.dev/docs/captions/create-tiktok-style-captions",
   "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/background-clip",
   "https://aegisub.org/docs/latest/ass_tags/"
  ],
