  "demoId": "kinetic-camera",
  "engine": "text",
  "category": "tx-layout",
  "title": "カメラ追従キネティック",
  "titleEn": "Kinetic Camera Follow",
  "pattern": "text-kinetic-camera",
  "duration": 6000,
  "motionDuration": 400,
  "easing": "cubic-bezier(.8,0,.2,1)",
  "feelings": [
   "きびきび",
   "重い"
  ],
  "usages": [
   "テキスト"
  ],
  "description": "大きさや向き(90°回転)の異なるフレーズが配置され、カメラが語から語へパン・回転・ズームしながら追っていく。",
  "descriptionEn": "Phrases of different sizes and orientations (rotated 90°) are laid out on a canvas, and a camera pans, rotates and zooms from one to the next.",
  "focus": "文字は動かず、カメラ（画面全体）が語から語へ回り込む。90° 回った語に着くとカメラも 90° 回るので、どの語も正面で読める。最後に引くと全体の配置が見える。",
  "focusEn": "The words never move — the camera swings from one to the next. Arriving at a 90°-rotated phrase, the camera rotates 90° too, so every phrase reads level. Pulling back at the end reveals the whole arrangement.",
  "caution": "回転とズームを同時に速くかけると酔いやすい。1 回の移動は 8–12 フレームでも、到着後に読めるだけ止める。動きを減らす設定ではカットでつなぐ。",
  "cautionEn": "Fast combined rotation and zoom can cause motion sickness. Moves can be 8–12 frames, but hold long enough to read after each arrival. With reduced motion, cut between phrases instead.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "回転 90° / 移動 8–12f / 強いイーズ（影響 80%） / 語ごとにポップイン",
  "recipeEn": "rotate 90° / 8–12 frame moves / strong ease (80% influence) / pop-in per phrase",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "時間・状態変化",
  "triggerEn": "Time or state change",
  "tech": [
   "CSS",
   "GSAP",
   "Remotion",
   "AE"
  ],
  "cost": "軽い",
  "costEn": "Light",
  "inputs": [
   "自動"
  ],
  "inputsEn": [
   "Automatic"
  ],
  "reduced": "動きを止め、文字が読める代表のコマを表示します。",
  "reducedEn": "Stop the motion and show a representative frame where the text is readable.",
  "accent": "purple",
  "featured": false,
  "values": [
   "回転 90°",
   "移動 8–12f",
   "強いイーズ（影響 80%）",
   "語ごとにポップイン"
  ],
  "valuesEn": [
   "rotate 90°",
   "8–12 frame moves",
   "strong ease (80% influence)",
   "pop-in per phrase"
  ],
  "recipes": {
   "gsap": "// 中身を動かすコンテナ＝カメラ。各フレーズの中心・角度・倍率へ順に移る\nconst tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { duration: .4, ease: 'expo.inOut' } });\nphrases.forEach(p => tl.to(stage, { x: -p.cx, y: -p.cy, rotation: -p.rot, scale: p.zoom, transformOrigin: '0 0' }).from(p.el, { scale: .5, autoAlpha: 0, duration: .24, ease: 'back.out(2)' }, '<.3').to({}, { duration: .45 }));",
   "remotion": "const cam = interpolate(frame, keyFrames, keyFrames.map((_, i) => i), { easing: Easing.bezier(.8, 0, .2, 1), extrapolateRight: 'clamp' });\nconst a = views[Math.floor(cam)], b = views[Math.ceil(cam)], u = cam % 1;\nreturn <AbsoluteFill style={{ transform: `scale(${lerp(a.z, b.z, u)}) rotate(${lerp(a.r, b.r, u)}deg) translate(${-lerp(a.x, b.x, u)}px, ${-lerp(a.y, b.y, u)}px)` }}>{phrases}</AbsoluteFill>;",
   "ae": "1. 各フレーズを別レイヤーで配置（大きさ違い、いくつかは 90° 回転）\n2. ヌルを作り、全テキストをその子にする（ヌル＝カメラの逆）\n3. ヌルの位置・回転・スケールを語ごとにキー、8–12 フレーム\n4. キーフレーム速度：影響 80%（強いイーズ）、語はオーディオマーカーでポップイン",
   "aeEn": "1. Place each phrase on its own layer (varied sizes, some rotated 90°)\n2. Parent all text to a Null (the null is the inverse camera)\n3. Key the null’s Position / Rotation / Scale per phrase, 8–12 frames apart\n4. Keyframe Velocity: 80% influence (strong ease); pop words in on audio markers"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinetic_typography"
  ],
  "unit": "phrase",
  "sampleJa": "聞いて それが 答えだ",
  "sampleEn": "Just listen.",
  "sourceLabel": "テキストモーション",
  "sourceLabelEn": "Text Motion",
  "code": {}
