  "description": "文字の上や周りに小さな星形がランダムな位置で次々と瞬き続ける。",
  "descriptionEn": "Small star shapes keep twinkling one after another at random positions on and around the text.",
  "focus": "星 1 つの一生は 0.8 秒（0 → 最大 → 0 に拡縮しながら 75°→150° 回る）。10 個の寿命をずらし、消えるたびに別の場所へ生まれ直すので、同時に光る数が常に揺らぐ。丸で囲んだ 1 つが追跡中の星。",
  "focusEn": "Each star lives 0.8s (scales 0 → max → 0 while turning 75°→150°). Ten lifetimes are offset and each star respawns somewhere new, so the number lit at once keeps changing. The ringed star is the one being tracked.",
  "caution": "星は文字の上に重なるので小さく、数は 10 前後まで。点滅の速さは 1 秒に 3 回を超えない（光過敏への配慮）。装飾なので SVG は aria-hidden、reduced-motion では止めて 2〜3 個を静止表示に。",
  "cautionEn": "Stars sit over the letters, so keep them small and around ten. Never flash more than 3 times a second (photosensitivity). They are decoration: aria-hidden on the SVGs, and under reduced motion freeze them as 2–3 static stars.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "life 0.8s / scale 0 → s → 0 / rotate 75° → 150° / count 10",
  "recipeEn": "life 0.8s / scale 0 → s → 0 / rotate 75° → 150° / count 10",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "時間・状態変化",
  "triggerEn": "Time or state change",
