  "demoId": "jump-sequence",
  "engine": "text",
  "category": "tx-loop",
  "title": "順番ジャンプ",
  "titleEn": "Sequential Hop",
  "pattern": "text-jump-sequence",
  "duration": 2400,
  "motionDuration": 400,
  "easing": "ease-out / ease-in (parabola)",
  "feelings": [
   "弾む",
   "きびきび"
  ],
  "usages": [
   "テキスト",
   "UI"
  ],
  "description": "文字が左から一つずつぴょんと跳ねては着地し、端まで行くとまた先頭から繰り返す。",
  "descriptionEn": "Characters hop up and land one at a time from the left; after the last one, the run starts again from the first.",
  "focus": "跳ぶのは常に 1〜2 文字だけで、他は静止している。その「休み」があるから順番が読める。着地でわずかにつぶれ、跳ぶ直前に沈むと重さが出る。下の帯が各文字のジャンプ区間。",
  "focusEn": "Only one or two characters are airborne at any moment; the rest wait, which is what makes the order readable. A small squash on landing and a dip before take-off give it weight. The bars below are each character’s hop window.",
  "caution": "全部の文字が跳び終わったあとに休み（ここでは 1 秒弱）を入れないと、ただのウェーブに見える。文字数が多いときは間隔を詰めて 1 周の長さを保つ。",
  "cautionEn": "Without a rest after the last hop (here just under a second) it turns into a plain wave. For long strings tighten the delay so one cycle keeps its length.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "translateY 0 → -40% → 0 / hop 0.4s in a 2.4s cycle / delay 0.1s / char / squash on landing",
  "recipeEn": "translateY 0 → -40% → 0 / hop 0.4s in a 2.4s cycle / delay 0.1s / char / squash on landing",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "時間・状態変化",
  "triggerEn": "Time or state change",
  "tech": [
   "CSS",
   "GSAP",
   "AE"
  ],
  "cost": "軽い",
  "costEn": "Light",
  "inputs": [
   "自動"
  ],
  "inputsEn": [
   "Automatic"
  ],
  "reduced": "動きを止め、文字が読める代表のコマを表示します。",
  "reducedEn": "Stop the motion and show a representative frame where the text is readable.",
  "accent": "coral",
  "featured": false,
  "values": [
   "translateY 0 → -40% → 0",
   "hop 0.4s in a 2.4s cycle",
   "delay 0.1s / char",
   "squash on landing"
  ],
  "valuesEn": [
   "translateY 0 → -40% → 0",
   "hop 0.4s in a 2.4s cycle",
   "delay 0.1s / char",
   "squash on landing"
  ],
  "recipes": {
   "css": "/* 1 周 2.4s のうち最初の 0.4s（16.7%）だけ跳ぶ */\n.hop span { display:inline-block; transform-origin: 50% 100%;\n  animation: hop 2.4s infinite; animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * .1s); }\n@keyframes hop {\n  0%     { transform: translateY(0); animation-timing-function: ease-out; }\n  8.3%   { transform: translateY(-40%); animation-timing-function: ease-in; }\n  16.7%  { transform: translateY(0) scale(1.1, .86); }\n  22%, 100% { transform: none; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .hop span { animation: none; } }",
   "gsap": "const split = SplitText.create('.hop', { type: 'chars' });\ngsap.timeline({ repeat: -1, repeatDelay: 1 })\n  .to(split.chars, { yPercent: -40, duration: .2, ease: 'power2.out', stagger: .1 })\n  .to(split.chars, { yPercent: 0, duration: .2, ease: 'power2.in', stagger: .1 }, .2);",
   "ae": "1. テキスト → アニメーター：位置 (0, -40%相当)\n2. 範囲セレクター：単位 インデックス、終了 = 開始 + 1（1 文字だけ選ぶ）\n3. オフセット 0 → 文字数 を 0.1s/字で、位置は跳ね上がりの山を量で付ける\n4. 位置の量に ease：上がり Ease Out / 下り Ease In",
   "aeEn": "1. Text → Animate: Position (0, about -40%)\n2. Range Selector: Units Index, End = Start + 1 (select a single character)\n3. Offset 0 → character count at 0.1s per character\n4. Ease the amount: Ease Out going up, Ease In coming down"
  },
