  "recipes": {
   "css": ".tate { writing-mode: vertical-rl; text-orientation: mixed; }\n.tate .tcy { text-combine-upright: all; }                /* 「12」などの縦中横 */\n.tate span { display:inline-block; opacity:0; transform: translateY(-20px);\n  animation: drop .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) forwards; animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 50ms); }\n@keyframes drop { to { opacity:1; transform:none; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .tate span { animation:none; opacity:1; transform:none; } }",
   "gsap": "// vertical-rl でも y は画面の上下。文字順に stagger すれば自然に右の列から進む\nconst split = SplitText.create('.tate', { type: 'chars' });\ngsap.from(split.chars, { y: -20, autoAlpha: 0, duration: 0.5, ease: 'expo.out', stagger: 0.05 });",
   "ae": "1. 縦書き文字ツールで入力（段落は縦組み）\n2. アニメーター：位置 (0,-20)・不透明度 0%\n3. 範囲セレクター：開始 0 → 100%（流れの向きに沿って上→下、右の列から）\n4. シェイプ 上へ傾斜、イーズ（高）50%",
   "aeEn": "1. Use the Vertical Type Tool\n2. Animate: Position (0,-20), Opacity 0%\n3. Range Selector Start 0 → 100% (follows the flow: top→bottom, right column first)\n4. Shape Ramp Up, Ease High 50%"
  },
