  "pattern": "text-cinema-handwritten-subtitle",
  "duration": 4400,
  "motionDuration": 4400,
  "easing": "none (cut)",
  "feelings": [
   "やわらかい"
  ],
  "usages": [
   "テキスト"
  ],
  "description": "不揃いな骨格と大きな濁点を持つ手書き風の字幕が、アニメーションなしでカットで出入りする。",
  "descriptionEn": "A handwritten-style subtitle with an uneven skeleton and oversized dakuten cuts in and out with no animation.",
  "focus": "映画字幕の手書き書体は、字ごとに傾き・大きさ・位置がわずかに不揃いで、濁点・半濁点が大きく離れて付く（小さな画面でも清音と見分けやすい）。動きは一切付けず、カットで出て消える。右上が通常の字形との比較。",
  "focusEn": "Film-subtitle handwriting is slightly uneven per character in tilt, size and position, with large, detached dakuten (easy to tell apart from unvoiced kana on a big screen). No motion at all: it cuts in and cuts out. The inset compares it with the regular glyph.",
  "caution": "雰囲気のために揺らしたりフェードしたりしない（読み取りの妨げ）。専用書体はライセンスを確認し、なければ通常の書体で 1 秒 4 文字の予算を守るほうが大事。不揃いさは静止したまま、毎回同じ形にする。",
  "cautionEn": "Don’t jitter or fade it for atmosphere — it hurts reading. License a proper cinema-subtitle face; without one, keeping to 4 characters per second in a regular face matters more. The irregularity is static — the same shape every time.",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "pop on / pop off (cut) / 4 chars / s / per-glyph tilt ±3°, size ±6% / oversized dakuten",
  "recipeEn": "pop on / pop off (cut) / 4 chars / s / per-glyph tilt ±3°, size ±6% / oversized dakuten",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "時間・状態変化",
  "triggerEn": "Time or state change",
  "tech": [
   "CSS",
   "Premiere"
  ],
  "cost": "軽い",
  "costEn": "Light",
  "inputs": [
   "自動"
  ],
  "inputsEn": [
   "Automatic"
  ],
  "reduced": "動きを止め、文字が読める代表のコマを表示します。",
  "reducedEn": "Stop the motion and show a representative frame where the text is readable.",
  "accent": "yellow",
  "featured": false,
  "values": [
   "pop on / pop off (cut)",
   "4 chars / s",
   "per-glyph tilt ±3°, size ±6%",
   "oversized dakuten"
  ],
  "valuesEn": [
   "pop on / pop off (cut)",
   "4 chars / s",
   "per-glyph tilt ±3°, size ±6%",
   "oversized dakuten"
  ],
  "recipes": {
   "css": "/* 映画字幕風の書体（ライセンスを確認）＋カットで出入り */\n@font-face { font-family: \"CinemaJP\"; src: url(cinema-letter.woff2) format(\"woff2\"); }\n.cue { font-family: \"CinemaJP\", \"Noto Sans JP\", sans-serif; color:#fff; text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #000;\n  visibility: hidden; }\n.cue.on { visibility: visible; }       /* opacity のトランジションは付けない */",
   "waapi": "// 字幕の IN/OUT は時刻で切り替えるだけ（.cue は visibility:hidden が初期値）\nconst count = s => [...s].reduce((a, c) => a + (/[\\x20-\\x7e]/.test(c) ? .5 : 1), 0);\nconst show = (el, inS, outS) => el.animate([{ visibility: 'visible' }, { visibility: 'visible' }],\n  { delay: inS * 1000, duration: (outS - inS) * 1000, easing: 'steps(1)' });\nshow(cue1, 0.35, 0.35 + count('君を忘れない') / 4);",
   "ae": "1. 映画字幕用の書体でテキストを作る（なければ通常の書体で）\n2. レイヤーのイン点・アウト点をそのまま字幕の IN/OUT に（キーフレームなし）\n3. 表示時間は 1 秒 4 文字から逆算\n4. フィルムの粒子は字幕の下の映像側にだけかける",
   "aeEn": "1. Set the text in a cinema-subtitle face (or a regular one if unavailable)\n2. Use layer in/out points as the subtitle IN/OUT (no keyframes)\n3. Derive the display time from 4 characters per second\n4. Apply film grain only to the footage beneath, not the subtitle"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/serial/font/1002663.html",
   "https://allabout.co.jp/gm/gc/452345/"
  ],
