  "recipes": {
   "css": "/* .stage は黒背景。カードの出入りだけを animation で */\n.card { opacity: 0; animation: card 4s ease-in-out forwards; }\n@keyframes card { 0% { opacity: 0 } 12.5% { opacity: 1 } 87.5% { opacity: 1 } 100% { opacity: 0 } }\n/* 0.5s in / 3s hold / 0.5s out */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .card { animation-timing-function: steps(1, end); } }",
   "gsap": "const words = card.textContent.trim().split(/\\s+/).length;\nconst hold = Math.max(1.5, words * .6) * 2;\ngsap.timeline()\n  .to(scene, { autoAlpha: 0, duration: .5 })\n  .fromTo(card, { autoAlpha: 0 }, { autoAlpha: 1, duration: .5, ease: 'sine.inOut' })\n  .to(card, { autoAlpha: 0, duration: .5, ease: 'sine.inOut' }, '+=' + hold);",
   "ae": "1. 映像クリップの終わりに「暗転（Dip to Black）」を 12 コマ\n2. 黒の上にタイトル：不透明度 0 → 100% を 12〜24 コマ\n3. 語数×0.6 秒（最低 1.5 秒）以上保持\n4. 不透明度 100 → 0% を同じ長さで",
   "aeEn": "1. Dip to Black on the outgoing shot, 12 frames\n2. Title over black: Opacity 0 → 100% over 12–24 frames\n3. Hold at least words × 0.6 s (min 1.5 s)\n4. Opacity 100 → 0% over the same length"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://www.ssw.com.au/rules/post-production-do-you-give-enough-time-to-read-texts-in-your-videos",
   "https://communicationsguide.ucdavis.edu/departments/video/best-practices/accessibility/text-on-screen"
  ],
