  "recipes": {
   "css": ".facade { transform: skewY(-11deg); }\n.role { animation: race-l .27s linear .6s both; }\n.name { animation: race-r .27s linear .95s both; }\n@keyframes race-l { from { transform: translateX(120vw); } }\n@keyframes race-r { from { transform: translateX(-120vw); } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .role, .name { animation: none; } }",
   "gsap": "const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: 'none', duration: .27 } });\ntl.fromTo('.bar-1', { x: '100vw' }, { x: '-100vw', duration: .4 })\n  .from('.role', { x: '100vw' }, '<.1')\n  .fromTo('.bar-2', { x: '-100vw' }, { x: '100vw', duration: .4 }, '+=.1')\n  .from('.name', { x: '-100vw' }, '<.1');",
   "ae": "1. 斜めの格子をシェイプで作り、コーナーピンで建物の面に合わせる\n2. 線（シェイプ）を 10 コマで画面を横切らせる（リニア）\n3. テキストを線の子にするか、線に少し遅れて同じ方向に 8 コマでスライド\n4. 退場は逆方向へ同じ速さで",
   "aeEn": "1. Build an oblique grid with shapes; Corner Pin it to a facade plane\n2. A bar crosses the frame in 10 frames, linear\n3. Parent text to the bar, or slide it 8 frames just behind it\n4. Exit in opposite directions at the same speed"
  },
