  "recipes": {
   "css": "/* 同じ見出しを 6 枚重ね、--k で帯を切り出す */\n.strip { position: absolute; inset: 0; clip-path: inset(calc(var(--k) * 16.66%) 0 calc(100% - (var(--k) + 1) * 16.66%) 0);\n  animation: strip .7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) calc(var(--k) * 60ms) both; }\n.strip:nth-child(odd) { --from: -120%; } .strip:nth-child(even) { --from: 120%; }\n@keyframes strip { from { transform: translateX(var(--from)); } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .strip { animation: none; } }",
   "gsap": "// .strip ×6 は aria-hidden、元の見出しは視覚的に隠して読み上げ用に残す\ngsap.from('.strip', { xPercent: i => (i % 2 ? 120 : -120), duration: .7, ease: 'expo.out', stagger: .06 });",
   "ae": "1. タイトルを 6 回複製し、それぞれ矩形マスクで横帯に切る\n2. 奇数は左 −120%、偶数は右 +120% から位置 X を 0 へ（イーズアウト強め）\n3. 2 コマずつずらす\n4. 各帯の前に細い平面を 2 コマ先行させる",
   "aeEn": "1. Duplicate the title 6 times; mask each to a horizontal strip\n2. Odd strips from −120%, even from +120%, Position X → 0 with strong ease-out\n3. Offset each by 2 frames\n4. A thin solid leads each strip by 2 frames"
  },
