  "recipes": {
   "css": ".word { opacity: 0; animation: stamp .17s steps(2, jump-none) calc(var(--i) * 360ms) forwards; }\n@keyframes stamp { 0% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.18) rotate(var(--r)); } 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) rotate(var(--r)); } }\n.word { -webkit-mask: url(ink.png) center / 200px; mask: url(ink.png) center / 200px; }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .word { animation: none; opacity: 1; } }",
   "gsap": "const split = SplitText.create('.title', { type: 'words', aria: 'auto' });\ngsap.set(split.words, { autoAlpha: 0 });\nconst tl = gsap.timeline();\nsplit.words.forEach((w, i) => tl\n  .set(w, { autoAlpha: 1, scale: 1.18 }, i * .36)\n  .set(w, { scale: 1 }, i * .36 + 2 / 12)\n  .set('.stage', { backgroundColor: colors[i % colors.length] }, i * .36));",
   "ae": "1. テキストにインクのテクスチャをトラックマットで重ねる\n2. 語ごとに不透明度を停止キーで 0 → 100（拍のマーカー上）\n3. スケール 118% → 100% を 2 コマ\n4. 調整レイヤーに posterizeTime(12)\n5. 背景の平面の色を拍ごとに停止キーで切り替え",
   "aeEn": "1. Track-matte an ink texture onto the text\n2. Per word, hold-key Opacity 0 → 100 on beat markers\n3. Scale 118% → 100% over 2 frames\n4. posterizeTime(12) on an adjustment layer\n5. Hold-key the background solid colour on each beat"
  },
