  "descriptionEn": "A warm, organic light leak drifts over the title and swells into a white burn at the transition.",
  "focus": "光は加算（スクリーン）で重なるので暗部だけが持ち上がる。切り替わりの頂点で一瞬白く焼け、その中から文字がにじみ出て光がゆっくり引いていく。",
  "focusEn": "The light adds (Screen/Add), lifting only the darks. At the peak the frame burns white, the title emerges inside it, and the glow slowly recedes.",
