  "recipes": {
   "css": ".stage::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: -20%; mix-blend-mode: screen; pointer-events: none;\n  background: radial-gradient(40% 50% at 20% 30%, #ffb35c, transparent), radial-gradient(30% 40% at 85% 75%, #ff6a3d, transparent);\n  animation: leak 1s ease-in-out both; }\n@keyframes leak { 0% { opacity: 0; translate: -20% 0; } 50% { opacity: 1; filter: brightness(2); } 100% { opacity: .35; translate: 10% 0; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .stage::after { animation: none; opacity: .3; } }",
   "gsap": "gsap.timeline()\n  .fromTo('.leak', { autoAlpha: 0, xPercent: -20 }, { autoAlpha: 1, xPercent: 0, duration: .45, ease: 'sine.in' })\n  .to('.burn', { opacity: .85, duration: .45, ease: 'sine.in' }, '<')\n  .set('.title', { autoAlpha: 1 })\n  .to('.burn', { opacity: 0, duration: .55, ease: 'sine.out' })\n  .fromTo('.title', { textShadow: '0 0 24px #ffb35c' }, { textShadow: '0 0 4px #ffb35c', duration: .9 }, '<');",
   "ae": "1. ライトリーク素材（またはフラクタルノイズ＋色）をスクリーン／加算で重ねる\n2. 切り替わりに 12〜24 コマの山を作り、露光量 +1 を頂点に\n3. タイトルのグロー：強度 0 → 強 → 弱\n4. 光は少しずつ流れ続けさせる（位置のゆっくりしたドリフト）",
   "aeEn": "1. Light-leak footage (or Fractal Noise + tint) in Screen/Add\n2. Build a 12–24 frame peak at the cut with Exposure +1\n3. Title Glow: 0 → strong → soft\n4. Keep the leak drifting slowly"
  },
