   "aeEn": "1. Two black solids (or a rectangle mask on an adjustment layer)\n2. Move top up and bottom down over 0.8 s, Easy Ease\n3. Stop at 2.39:1 (138 px bars at 1920×1080)\n4. Fade the title in 0.5 s later"
