  "reduced": "動きを止め、文字が読める代表のコマを表示します。",
  "reducedEn": "Stop the motion and show a representative frame where the text is readable.",
  "accent": "purple",
  "featured": false,
  "values": [
   "8〜16 行",
   "1 列 / 30〜60ms",
   "消灯の点も描く",
   "shadowBlur で発光"
  ],
  "valuesEn": [
   "8–16 rows",
   "1 column per 30–60 ms",
   "draw unlit dots too",
   "glow via shadowBlur"
  ],
  "recipes": {
   "canvas": "// 1) 文字を小さなキャンバスに描いてビットマップ化\nconst b = document.createElement('canvas'), bx = b.getContext('2d', { willReadFrequently: true });\nb.height = 16; bx.font = '700 15px sans-serif'; b.width = Math.ceil(bx.measureText(text).width);\nbx.font = '700 15px sans-serif'; bx.textBaseline = 'middle'; bx.fillText(text, 0, 8);\nconst px = bx.getImageData(0, 0, b.width, 16).data;\n// 2) 45ms ごとに 1 列送って点で描く\nconst tick = Math.floor(performance.now() / 45);\nfor (let c = 0; c < COLS; c++) for (let r = 0; r < 16; r++) {\n  const x = (c + tick) % (b.width + GAP), on = x < b.width && px[(r * b.width + x) * 4 + 3] > 100;\n  ctx.fillStyle = on ? '#ff8a3d' : '#2a2a2a'; ctx.shadowBlur = on ? 8 : 0;\n  ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(c * 6 + 3, r * 6 + 3, 2.3, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.fill();\n}",
   "css": "/* ドット柄のマスクを文字に重ね、steps() で 1 列ずつ送る */\n.led { color: #ff8a3d; text-shadow: 0 0 6px currentColor;\n  -webkit-mask: radial-gradient(circle, #000 45%, transparent 50%) 0 0 / 6px 6px;\n  mask: radial-gradient(circle, #000 45%, transparent 50%) 0 0 / 6px 6px; }\n.led span { display: inline-block; animation: led 6s steps(100) infinite; }\n@keyframes led { from { transform: translateX(300px); } to { transform: translateX(-300px); } }   /* 6px × 100 */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .led span { animation: none; } }",
   "ae": "1. テキストを横に流す（位置 X）\n2. 位置に posterizeTime(22)（1 列 ≈45ms）＋ 1 列の幅で Math.round\n3. モザイク → CC Ball Action（グリッド間隔 = 点の間隔）\n4. グローで発光",
   "aeEn": "1. Scroll the text horizontally\n2. Position: posterizeTime(22) (≈45 ms per column), rounded to the dot pitch\n3. Mosaic → CC Ball Action (grid spacing = dot pitch)\n4. Glow"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telop"
  ],
  "unit": "char",
