   "aeEn": "1. Text: Scale 70 → 100% with overshoot over 7 frames\n2. CC Particle World (or star sprites) around the text for 0.5–1 s\n3. Light sweep: a white diagonal band through the text as alpha matte\n4. Two or three small twinkles during the hold"
